mi. La divertente vita un po' sciocca, ma carina di queste liceali sia durante la scuola che nella loro vita privata."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Joshi Kausei","overview":"A silent high school girl anime that's still cute, even if no one talks!  This is a story about three girls and their fun high school life, centering around the unfortunate beauty, Momoko, the cool girl with glasses, Shibumi, and the gentle little Mayumi.  Fun alone, fun with all. The daily lives of slightly dumb yet cute high school girls."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"残念美人のもも子を中心に、クール系メガネのしぶ美&癒し系ちびっ子まゆみの3人が過ごす楽しい高校生活♪１人でも楽しい、みんなと一緒でも楽しい、ちょいバカでぐうかわな彼女たちの日常","tagline":"おバカわいい　この日常がたぶん青春"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jRUdBBLcwAWu1nSTMWolLXgUOZV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jRUdBBLcwAWu1nSTMWolLXgUOZV.png","language":"ja","width":447,"height":194}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXoquJVPVojqBi78eecr2jLWXaM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXoquJVPVojqBi78eecr2jLWXaM.jpg","language":"ja","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/339Whz6cvEmsyBAcuqv2wtGLVUH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/339Whz6cvEmsyBAcuqv2wtGLVUH.jpg","language":"ja","width":640,"height":960}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z6w2UotGQGVlp7ldPAvUp7qbIzf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z6w2UotGQGVlp7ldPAvUp7qbIzf.jpg","language":"xx","width":2707,"height":1523},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/78pA8Pwar1IOJTEBl9z4s4uJRmH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/78pA8Pwar1IOJTEBl9z4s4uJRmH.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2YNwibCNMuGGMvXHKz85nWrRLRx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2YNwibCNMuGGMvXHKz85nWrRLRx.jpg","language":"xx","width":2707,"h